                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    用 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridSelectColumn</code> 实现基于复选框的行选择。
                    表头的复选框可切换当页的全选。已选数量会显示在分页底栏中。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Use <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridSelectColumn</code> for checkbox-based
                    row selection. The header checkbox toggles select-all for the current page.
                    Selected count is shown in the pagination footer.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5"
                   SelectionMode="DataTableSelectionMode.Multiple"
                   SelectedItemsChanged="HandleSelectionChanged">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridSelectColumn TData="Person" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        @if (_selectedPeople.Count > 0)
        {
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    已选中：@string.Join("、", _selectedPeople.Select(p => p.Name))
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Selected: @string.Join(", ", _selectedPeople.Select(p => p.Name))
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        }
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/row-selection.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Selection Behaviour (Replace) ──────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("选择行为", "Selection Behaviour")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    默认情况下，点击某一行只切换那一行，其余行不受影响。把
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SelectionBehavior="DataGridSelectionBehavior.Replace"</code>
                    设好后，就得到用户从文件管理器带来的那套习惯：普通单击只选中被点击的行，
                    <strong>Shift+单击</strong> 选中从锚点行起的区间，
                    <strong>Ctrl+单击</strong>（macOS 上是 Cmd+单击）逐行增删。点击唯一选中的那行会清空选择。
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    区间从<em>锚点</em>起算——也就是最后一次普通单击或 Ctrl+单击所在的行——而不是从最后被选中的行起算。
                    先点一行，再 Ctrl+点第二行，然后 Shift+点第三行：区间从被 Ctrl+点的那一行开始。
                    这里没有选择列，因为行点击本身才是主角；若存在选择列，它的复选框仍是切换语义，
                    聚焦行上的空格键与回车键也一样。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    By default a row click toggles that one row and leaves the rest alone. Set
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SelectionBehavior="DataGridSelectionBehavior.Replace"</code>
                    for the conventions a user brings from a file explorer: a plain click selects only the clicked
                    row, <strong>Shift+Click</strong> selects the range from the anchor row, and
                    <strong>Ctrl+Click</strong> (Cmd+Click on macOS) adds or removes one row. Clicking the only
                    selected row clears the selection.
                </p>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    The range extends from the <em>anchor</em> — the row of the last plain click or Ctrl+Click —
                    not from the last selected row. Click a row, Ctrl+Click a second, then Shift+Click a third:
                    the range starts at the Ctrl+Clicked row. There is no select column here, because a row click
                    is the whole point; where a select column is present its checkboxes keep toggle semantics, and
                    so do the Space and Enter keys on a focused row.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="8"
                   SelectionMode="DataTableSelectionMode.Multiple"
                   SelectionBehavior="DataGridSelectionBehavior.Replace"
                   SelectedItemsChanged="HandleReplaceSelectionChanged">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            @if (_replaceSelectedPeople.Count > 0)
            {
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                    <text>已选中 @_replaceSelectedPeople.Count 项：@string.Join("、", _replaceSelectedPeople.Select(p => p.Name))</text>
                }
                else
                {
                    <text>Selected @_replaceSelectedPeople.Count: @string.Join(", ", _replaceSelectedPeople.Select(p => p.Name))</text>
                }
            }
            else
            {
                @if (L.IsChinese)
                {
                    <text>未选中任何行。</text>
                }
                else
                {
                    <text>Nothing selected.</text>
                }
            }
        </p>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/selection-behavior.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Per-Page Select-All (SelectAllScope) ──────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("当页全选", "Per-Page Select-All")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    默认情况下，分页网格的表头复选框会打开一个菜单，用来选择当前页的所有行或跨越所有页的所有行。
                    设置
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SelectAllScope="DataGridSelectAllScope.CurrentPage"</code>
                    就能去掉这个菜单——此后表头复选框只切换当前页的行，其他页上的选择原样不动。
                    选中若干行后翻页，上一页的选择依然保留。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    By default, the header checkbox of a paginated grid opens a menu to select all rows on the
                    current page or across every page. Set
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SelectAllScope="DataGridSelectAllScope.CurrentPage"</code>
                    to remove that menu — the header checkbox then toggles only the current page's rows and leaves
                    selections on other pages untouched. Select some rows, change pages, and the previous page's
                    selection is preserved.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5"
                   SelectionMode="DataTableSelectionMode.Multiple"
                   SelectedItemsChanged="HandlePerPageSelectionChanged">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridSelectColumn TData="Person" SelectAllScope="DataGridSelectAllScope.CurrentPage" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
                <text>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                跨页已选中：<span class="font-medium">@_perPageSelectedCount</span> 行
            </p>
                </text>
}
        else
        {
                <text>
                    <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                Selected across all pages: <span class="font-medium">@_perPageSelectedCount</span>
            </p>
                </text>
}
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/select-all-scope.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Compact Rows (CellClass / HeaderClass) ─────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("紧凑行（CellClass / HeaderClass）", "Compact Rows (CellClass / HeaderClass)")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    每一列 &mdash; 包括 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridSelectColumn</code> 在内 &mdash;
                    都接受 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">CellClass</code> 与
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">HeaderClass</code>。把更小的内边距，例如
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">CellClass="p-1"</code>，应用到每一列（复选框列也不例外），
                    就能得到一张密集的网格 &mdash; 选择列不再强行把行撑高。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Every column &mdash; including <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridSelectColumn</code> &mdash;
                    accepts <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">CellClass</code> and
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">HeaderClass</code>. Apply a smaller padding such as
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">CellClass="p-1"</code> to every column, the checkbox column
                    included, for a dense grid &mdash; the select column no longer forces a taller row.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5"
                   SelectionMode="DataTableSelectionMode.Multiple">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridSelectColumn TData="Person" CellClass="p-1" HeaderClass="p-1" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" CellClass="p-1" HeaderClass="p-1" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" CellClass="p-1" HeaderClass="p-1" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" CellClass="p-1" HeaderClass="p-1" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" CellClass="p-1" HeaderClass="p-1" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/compact-rows.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Expandable Rows ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("可展开行", "Expandable Rows")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    添加 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridExpandColumn</code> 并提供一个
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DetailTemplate</code>，就能在每行下方展开额外内容。
                    点击箭头图标即可切换展开状态。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Add <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridExpandColumn</code> and provide a
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DetailTemplate</code> to reveal additional content
                    beneath each row. Click the chevron to toggle expansion.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridExpandColumn />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" />
            </Columns>
            <DetailTemplate>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
