            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("可缩放列", "Resizable Columns")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    设置 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Resizable="true"</code> 即可启用列缩放。
                    拖动任意列表头的右边缘即可调整宽度。内部使用
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">table-layout: fixed</code> 实现精确的宽度控制。
                    单列可以用 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Resizable="false"</code> 退出。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Set <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Resizable="true"</code> to enable column resizing.
                    Drag the right edge of any column header to resize. Uses <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">table-layout: fixed</code>
                    for precise width control. Individual columns can opt out with <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Resizable="false"</code>.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5" Resizable="true">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable NoWrap Width="200px" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Sortable Width="250px" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable Width="150px" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)" Width="150px" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable Width="120px" />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/resizable-columns.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Reorderable Columns ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("可重排列", "Reorderable Columns")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    设置 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Reorderable="true"</code> 即可启用拖放式列重排。
                    拖动某个表头就能把它移到新位置，放置目标会有可视指示。单列可以用
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Reorderable="false"</code> 退出。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Set <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Reorderable="true"</code> to enable drag-and-drop
                    column reordering. Drag a column header to move it to a new position. A visual indicator shows
                    the drop target. Individual columns can opt out with <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Reorderable="false"</code>.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5" Reorderable="true">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/reorderable-columns.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Reordering With Pinned And Selection Columns ─────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("与固定列、选择列并存的重排", "Reordering With Pinned And Selection Columns")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    重排可以与固定列、选择列共存。固定的列既不可拖动，也不接受放置，因此它们始终钉在网格的两端——
                    只有中间那些未固定的列可以被重新排列。选择框列同样钉在原地。
                    拖拽 <strong>Email</strong>、<strong>Department</strong>、<strong>Role</strong> 或
                    <strong>Age</strong>，即可在两端固定的 Name 列与「操作」列之间重排它们。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Reordering coexists with pinning and the selection column. Pinned columns are never draggable and
                    never accept a drop, so they stay anchored to the edges of the grid — only the unpinned columns
                    in the middle can be rearranged. The selection checkbox column is likewise fixed in place.
                    Drag <strong>Email</strong>, <strong>Department</strong>, <strong>Role</strong> or
                    <strong>Age</strong> to reorder them between the pinned Name and Actions columns.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <div style="max-width: 800px; overflow-x: auto;">
            <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5" Reorderable="true"
                        SelectionMode="DataTableSelectionMode.Multiple">
                <Columns>
                    <DataGridSelectColumn TData="Person" Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Left" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)"
                        Sortable Width="160px" Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Left" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Width="220px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Width="180px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)" Width="160px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Age)" Width="100px" />
                    <DataGridTemplateColumn TData="Person" Title="@(L.T("操作", "Actions"))" Width="140px"
                        Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Right"
                        CellClass="text-right">
                        <HeaderTemplate>
                            <span class="w-full text-right">@L.T("操作", "Actions")</span>
                        </HeaderTemplate>
                        <ChildContent Context="person">
                            <div @onclick:stopPropagation="true" class="inline-flex justify-end w-full">
                                <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small">@L.T("编辑", "Edit")</Button>
                            </div>
                        </ChildContent>
                    </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                </Columns>
            </DataGrid>
        </div>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/reorderable-pinned-columns.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Explicit Column Order ────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("显式列顺序", "Explicit Column Order")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    列的位置取决于它们的组件完成初始化的顺序；就直接写在网格标记里的列而言，那就是声明顺序。
                    间接生成的列会比它周围的列更晚初始化，否则就会漂到末尾——下面的
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;SalaryColumn /&gt;</code> 就是一个可复用组件，
                    它内部渲染自己的 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridPropertyColumn</code>。
                    给这样的列设置 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Order</code>，就能把它钉在数据列中的某个
                    从零开始的序号上。没有设置 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Order</code> 的列保持声明顺序
                    围绕它排列，因此其他地方都不必改动。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Columns take their position from the order their components initialize in, which for a column
                    written directly in the grid's markup is the order it was declared. A column produced indirectly
                    initializes later than the columns around it and would otherwise drift to the end — the
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">&lt;SalaryColumn /&gt;</code> below is a reusable
                    component that renders a <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridPropertyColumn</code>
                    of its own. Set <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Order</code> on such a column to pin it
                    to a zero-based index among the data columns. Columns that leave
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Order</code> unset keep their declared order around it,
                    so nothing else needs to change.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Sortable />
                <SalaryColumn Order="2" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/column-order.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Column Visibility ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("列可见性", "Column Visibility")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    把 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Toolbar</code> 参数与
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridColumnVisibility</code> 一起使用，
                    即可加入一个让用户显示或隐藏列的下拉菜单。设置了
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Hideable="false"</code> 的列不会出现在这个开关里。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Use the <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Toolbar</code> parameter with
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridColumnVisibility</code> to add a
                    dropdown that lets users show or hide columns. Columns with <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Hideable="false"</code>
                    are excluded from the toggle.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5">
            <Toolbar>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <DataGridColumnVisibility TData="Person" />
                </div>
            </Toolbar>
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable Hideable="false" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/column-visibility.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Pinned Columns ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("固定列", "Pinned Columns")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    在任意列上设置 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Left"</code> 或
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Right"</code>，
                    即可借助 CSS 的 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">position: sticky</code>
                    把它钉在可滚动视口的边缘。偏移量会自动计算。水平滚动即可看到固定列留在原地。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Set <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Left"</code> or
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Right"</code> on any column
                    to pin it to the edge of the scrollable viewport using CSS
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">position: sticky</code>.
                    Offsets are computed automatically. Scroll horizontally to see pinned columns stay in place.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <div style="max-width: 700px; overflow: auto;">
            <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5"
                       SelectionMode="DataTableSelectionMode.Multiple">
                <Columns>
                    <DataGridSelectColumn TData="Person" Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Left" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)"
                        Sortable Width="180px" Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Left" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)"
                        Width="220px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)"
                        Width="180px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)"
                        Width="160px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Age)"
                        Width="100px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)"
                        Format="C0" Width="140px" />
                    <DataGridTemplateColumn TData="Person" Title="@(L.T("操作", "Actions"))" Width="200px"
                        Pinned="AtomBlazor.Primitives.ColumnPinning.Right"
                        CellClass="text-right">
                        <HeaderTemplate>
                            <span class="w-full text-right">@L.T("操作", "Actions")</span>
                        </HeaderTemplate>
                        <ChildContent Context="person">
                            <div @onclick:stopPropagation="true" class="inline-flex justify-end w-full">
                                <SplitButton Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small">
                                    <ChildContent>@L.T("编辑", "Edit")</ChildContent>
                                    <DropdownContent>
                                        <SplitButtonItem>@L.T("复制", "Duplicate")</SplitButtonItem>
                                        <SplitButtonItem>@L.T("归档", "Archive")</SplitButtonItem>
                                        <SplitButtonSeparator />
                                        <SplitButtonItem>@L.T("删除", "Delete")</SplitButtonItem>
                                    </DropdownContent>
                                </SplitButton>
                            </div>
                        </ChildContent>
                    </DataGridTemplateColumn>
                </Columns>
            </DataGrid>
        </div>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/pinned-columns.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Global Search ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("全局搜索", "Global Search")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    添加 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ShowSearch="true"</code> 会渲染一个带防抖的搜索输入框，
                    它在所有开启了 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Filterable=true</code> 的列上进行筛选。
                    对于服务端网格，搜索文本通过
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridRequest.SearchText</code> 传入。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Add <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ShowSearch="true"</code> to render a
                    debounced search input that filters across all columns with
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Filterable=true</code>.
                    For server-side grids, the search text is passed via
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridRequest.SearchText</code>.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="5" ShowSearch>
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable Filterable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" Filterable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable Filterable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable Filterable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/global-search.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Async Data Loading ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("异步数据加载（ItemsProvider）", "Async Data Loading (ItemsProvider)")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    用 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ItemsProvider</code> 做服务端取数。
                    网格把排序与分页参数传给它，由它返回数据。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Use <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ItemsProvider</code> for server-side data fetching.
                    The grid passes sort and pagination parameters and the provider returns the data.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" ItemsProvider="@LoadPeopleAsync" InitialPageSize="5">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Age)" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/async-loading.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Virtualization ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("虚拟化（1000 行）", "Virtualization (1000 rows)")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    启用 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Virtualize="true"</code> 以流畅渲染大型数据集，
                    只有可见的行会进入 DOM。使用 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">StickyHeader="true"</code>
                    让表头在滚动时保持可见。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Enable <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Virtualize="true"</code> for smooth
                    rendering of large datasets. Only visible rows are rendered in the DOM.
                    Use <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">StickyHeader="true"</code> to keep the header
                    visible while scrolling.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <div style="height: 400px; overflow: auto;">
            <DataGrid TData="Person" Items="@manyPeople" ShowPagination="false"
                       Virtualize="true" ItemSize="48" StickyHeader="true">
                <Columns>
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Id)" Title="#" Width="60px" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                    <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable />
                </Columns>
            </DataGrid>
        </div>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/virtualization.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Server-Side Virtual Scroll ─────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("服务端虚拟滚动", "Server-Side Virtual Scroll")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    把 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Virtualize="true"</code> 与
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ItemsProvider</code> 组合起来，就是真正的服务端无限滚动。
                    随着用户滚动，Virtualize 组件只向服务器请求可见行加上一段预取余量。分页会自动隐藏。
                    用 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">VirtualScrollHeight</code> 设置滚动容器的高度。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Combine <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Virtualize="true"</code> with
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">ItemsProvider</code> for true server-side
                    infinite scroll. The Virtualize component requests only the visible rows plus overscan
                    from the server as the user scrolls. Pagination is automatically hidden.
                    Use <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">VirtualScrollHeight</code> to set the
                    scroll container height.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid TData="Person" ItemsProvider="@VirtualServerProviderAsync"
                   Virtualize="true" ItemSize="48" VirtualScrollHeight="400px"
                   StickyHeader="true">
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Id)" Title="#" Width="60px" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Email)" />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        @if (L.IsChinese)
        {
                <text>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
                正在 10,000 条记录中滚动 —— 只有可见的行会从模拟服务器取回。
            </p>
                </text>
}
        else
        {
                <text>
