                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Use <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridGroupColumn</code> for declarative
                    grouping with a custom header template. The template receives a <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">DataGridGroupContext</code>
