    <!-- ── Interactive Grouping ─────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("交互式分组", "Interactive Grouping")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    给列加上 <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Groupable</code> 标记，用户就能在运行时按该列分组。
                    列头里会出现一个省略号菜单，其中带有“分组依据”操作，网格无需刷新页面就能重新分组。
                    一旦已经有分组，菜单还会提供“再按此列分组”，在第一个层级里嵌套出第二个层级——参见下面的嵌套分组。
                    没有加上该标记的列（例如 Name）不提供菜单。
                    分组也可以由代码驱动，调用
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">GroupByColumnAsync</code>，它接受一个
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SortDirection</code> 来控制分组标题自身的顺序——
                    下面的按钮按同一列在两个方向上分组。每个分组<em>内部</em>的排序仍由该列自己的排序掌控。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Mark a column <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">Groupable</code> to let users group by it
                    at runtime. An ellipsis menu appears in the column header with a "Group by" action, and the grid
                    regroups without a page refresh. Once something is grouped the menu also offers "Then group by",
                    which nests a second level inside the first — see Nested Grouping below.
                    Columns left without the flag (like Name) offer no menu.
                    Grouping can also be driven from code with
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">GroupByColumnAsync</code>, which takes a
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SortDirection</code> controlling the order of the group
                    headers themselves — the buttons below group by the same column in each direction. Sorting
                    <em>within</em> each group stays under the column's own sort.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
        </div>
        <DataGrid @ref="interactiveGroupingGrid" TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="50">
            <Toolbar>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small"
                              OnClick="@(() => interactiveGroupingGrid!.GroupByColumnAsync("department"))">
                        @L.T("按 Department 分组（A–Z）", "Group by Department (A–Z)")
                    </Button>
                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small"
                              OnClick="@(() => interactiveGroupingGrid!.GroupByColumnAsync("department", SortDirection.Descending))">
                        @L.T("按 Department 分组（Z–A）", "Group by Department (Z–A)")
                    </Button>
                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small"
                              OnClick="@(() => interactiveGroupingGrid!.ClearGroupingAsync())">
                        @L.T("清除分组", "Clear grouping")
                    </Button>
                </div>
            </Toolbar>
            <Columns>
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Name)" Sortable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Department)" Sortable Groupable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Status)" Sortable Groupable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="string" Property="@(p => p.Role)" Groupable />
                <DataGridPropertyColumn TData="Person" TProp="int" Property="@(p => p.Salary)" Format="C0" Sortable
                    Aggregate="AtomBlazor.Primitives.AggregateFunction.Sum" />
            </Columns>
        </DataGrid>
        <CodeBlock Source="Components/DataGrid/interactive-grouping.txt" />
    </div>

    <!-- ── Nested Grouping ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">@L.T("嵌套分组", "Nested Grouping")</h2>
            @if (L.IsChinese)
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    分组可以嵌套任意层数。在某个列的省略号菜单里使用“再按此列分组”，或者由代码调用
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">AddGroupByColumnAsync</code> 与
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SetGroupingAsync</code>。网格上方的面包屑会按顺序显示各个层级，
                    用它就能去掉某一层，或把某一层向外移动一级。
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            else
            {
                        <text>
                            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                    Grouping nests to any depth. Use "Then group by" in a column's ellipsis menu, or call
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">AddGroupByColumnAsync</code> and
                    <code class="bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 rounded">SetGroupingAsync</code> from code. The breadcrumb above
                    the grid shows the levels in order; use it to drop a level or move one outward.
                </p>
                        </text>
}
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                @L.T("每个表头都能单独折叠，同一个键在不同父级之下仍然各算各的——收起 Engineering 下的 Active，Sales 下的 Active 依旧是展开的。聚合会向上汇总，因此某个部门的表头累计的是它之下的每一行，而不仅仅是自己这一层。这里的每页条数故意设得很小：翻页时，第一行之上的所有表头都会在页首重复出现，这样任何一行都不会脱离说明它归属的表头单独显示。", "Each header collapses on its own, and the same key under different parents stays separate — collapsing Active under Engineering leaves Active under Sales open. Aggregates roll up, so a department header sums every row beneath it, not just its own level. The page size here is deliberately small: page through and every header above the first row is repeated at the top of the page, so a row is never shown without the headers that say what it belongs to.")
            </p>
        </div>
        <DataGrid @ref="nestedGroupingGrid" TData="Person" Items="@people" InitialPageSize="8">
            <Toolbar>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <Button Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Size="ButtonSize.Small"
                              OnClick="@(() => nestedGroupingGrid!.SetGroupingAsync(new[] { "department", "status" }))">
